@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### List vehicles
GET {{host}}/api/vehicles?q=volvo&page=1&pageSize=10

### Register a vehicle
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licensePlate": "FT-2001",
  "make": "Scania",
  "model": "R450",
  "year": 2019,
  "fuelType": 1,
  "odometerKm": 0
}

### Alerts
GET {{host}}/api/reports/alerts
